  "details": "# Issue:\n\nWhen you open the camera after having taken a Sticker Photo the Camera Mode will be set to Emoji instead of Sticker.\n\n**Reproduction Steps:**\n\n1. Open the Camera\n\n2. Set the Camera Mode to Sticker\n\n3. Take a Photo\n\n4. Cancel or Save it (doesn't matter what you do here)\n\n5. Close the Main Menu and Open the Camera Again\n\nIf you do this you will notice that the Camera Mode is now set to Emoji instead of Sticker\n\n# Expected Behaviour:\n\nOpening the Camera after having taken a Sticker Photo should result in the Camera still being in Sticker Mode and not Emoji.\n\n# Attachments:\n\nHere is a video showcasing the issue:",
